{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-template-js","path":"/Web/JS/async_and_await/","result":{"data":{"cur":{"id":"8a57be77-efc1-56fb-ad89-2cf8ad7c6df5","html":"<h1 id=\"async--await\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#async--await\" aria-label=\"async  await permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>async &#x26; await</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">AsyncFunction</code>객체를 반환하는 하나의 비동기 함수를 정의합니다. 비동기 함수는 이벤트 루프를 통해 비동기적으로 작동하는 함수로, 암시적으로 <code class=\"language-text\">Promise</code>를 사용하여 결과를 반환합니다.  </p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\">  <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">name</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>param<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> param<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token operator\">...</span> param<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        statements\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n</blockquote>\n<p>→ Promise의 단점을 보완해주는 비동기 처리 방식</p>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h3 id=\"async\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#async\" aria-label=\"async permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>async</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>함수 선언 시 <strong>함수</strong> 앞에 <code class=\"language-text\">async</code>  </li>\n<li>promise 객체 반환<br>\n<br><br></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"awiat\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#awiat\" aria-label=\"awiat permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>awiat</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>promise 객체</strong> 앞에 <code class=\"language-text\">await</code>  </li>\n<li>promise가 완료될 때까지 대기  </li>\n<li>async 함수 내부에서만 사용 가능<br>\n<br><br><br></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"사용\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%82%AC%EC%9A%A9\" aria-label=\"사용 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>사용</h2>\n<p>await 키워드를 붙인 비동기 작업이 완료될 때까지 대기했다가 다음 작업을 수행한다.  </p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\"><span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">delay</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">ms</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Promise</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">resolve</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token function\">setTimeout</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>resolve<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> ms<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">example</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'Task 1'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"token function\">delay</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token number\">3000</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'Task 2'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token function\">example</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 506px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 43.333333333333336%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"async &amp; await 사용 예시\"\n        title=\"async &amp; await 사용 예시\"\n        src=\"/static/33853ca07e0ff851e8a0b22f3ab32060/29f4e/async_and_await_example.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/33853ca07e0ff851e8a0b22f3ab32060/e9ff0/async_and_await_example.png 180w,\n/static/33853ca07e0ff851e8a0b22f3ab32060/f21e7/async_and_await_example.png 360w,\n/static/33853ca07e0ff851e8a0b22f3ab32060/29f4e/async_and_await_example.png 506w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 506px) 100vw, 506px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      />\n    </span>  </p>\n<p><br><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"promise-vs-asyncawait\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#promise-vs-asyncawait\" aria-label=\"promise vs asyncawait permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Promise VS async/await</h2>\n<h3 id=\"promise\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#promise\" aria-label=\"promise permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Promise</h3>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 720px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 43.888888888888886%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"promise hell 예시 코드\"\n        title=\"promise hell 예시 코드\"\n        src=\"/static/c5d54c974812fca69693618059c0ee5c/37523/promise_hell.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/c5d54c974812fca69693618059c0ee5c/e9ff0/promise_hell.png 180w,\n/static/c5d54c974812fca69693618059c0ee5c/f21e7/promise_hell.png 360w,\n/static/c5d54c974812fca69693618059c0ee5c/37523/promise_hell.png 720w,\n/static/c5d54c974812fca69693618059c0ee5c/302a4/promise_hell.png 1080w,\n/static/c5d54c974812fca69693618059c0ee5c/bb072/promise_hell.png 1318w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      />\n    </span>  </p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\"><span class=\"token function\">getPost</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>postNum<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">then</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">postId</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'Post:'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> postId<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token function\">getComments</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>postId<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">then</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">result</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'Comments:'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> result<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">catch</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">error</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>error<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>→ promise 체이닝으로 인한 <code class=\"language-text\">.then() 지옥</code>의 가능성 (가독성 저하)<br>\n→ <code class=\"language-text\">.catch()</code>문을 통해 에러 핸들링<br>\n<br><br></p>\n<h3 id=\"asyncawait\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#asyncawait\" aria-label=\"asyncawait permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>async/await</h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\"><span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">getResult</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n\t<span class=\"token keyword\">try</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> postId_result <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"token function\">getPost</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>postNum<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> comments_result <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"token function\">getComments</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>postId_result<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"Post:\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> postId_result<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Comments:\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> comments_result<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\t<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">catch</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>error<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n\t\tconsole<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>error<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n  \n<span class=\"token function\">getResult</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>→ <code class=\"language-text\">.then()</code> 중첩 없이 간결하게 표현 가능<br>\n→ <code class=\"language-text\">try-catch()</code>문을 통해 에러 핸들링 (에러 발생 위치 알기 쉬움)<br>\n→ 비동기 작업 흐름을 명확하게 보여줌  </p>\n<h3 id=\"try-catch\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#try-catch\" aria-label=\"try catch permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>try-catch</h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\"><span class=\"token keyword\">try</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token comment\">// 예외가 발생할 수 있는 코드</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> result <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">exampleFunction</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>result<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">catch</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>error<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token comment\">// 오류 처리를 위한 코드</span>\n  console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">error</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'오류가 발생했습니다:'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> error<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>message<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<ol>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">try</code> 블록 실행  </li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">try</code> 블록 내에서 예외/오류가 발생 → 해당 블록 내 코드 실행 즉시 중단, 해당 <code class=\"language-text\">catch</code> 블록으로 이동 (<code class=\"language-text\">try</code> 블록 내 오류가 없을 경우 <code class=\"language-text\">catch</code> 블록 건너뛰고 계속 진행)  </li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">catch</code> 블록 내의 코드 실행  </li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">catch</code> 블록 실행 후, 이후 프로그램 계속 진행<br>\n<br><br><br></li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>references</strong><br>\n👉 <a href=\"https://inpa.tistory.com/entry/JS-%F0%9F%93%9A-%EB%B9%84%EB%8F%99%EA%B8%B0%EC%B2%98%EB%A6%AC-async-await\">https://inpa.tistory.com/entry/JS-%F0%9F%93%9A-%EB%B9%84%EB%8F%99%EA%B8%B0%EC%B2%98%EB%A6%AC-async-await</a></p>","excerpt":"async & await 객체를 반환하는 하나의 비동기 함수를 정의합니다. 비동기 함수는 이벤트 루프를 통해 비동기적으로 작동하는 함수로, 암시적으로 를 사용하여 결과를 반환합니다.   → Promise의 단점을 보완해주는 비동기 처리 방식  async 함수 선언 시 함수 앞에    promise 객체 반환  awiat promise 객체 앞에    promise가 완료될 때까지 대기   async 함수 내부에서만 사용 가능  사용 await 키워드를 붙인 비동기 작업이 완료될 때까지 대기했다가 다음 작업을 수행한다.       Promise VS async/await Promise    → promise 체이닝으로 인한 의 가능성 (가독성 저하) → 문을 통해 에러 핸들링  async/await →  중첩 없이 간결하게 표현 가능 → 문을 통해 에러 핸들링 (에러 발생 위치 알기 쉬움) → 비동기 작업 흐름을 명확하게 보여줌   try-catch  블록 실행    블록 내에서 예…","frontmatter":{"date":"August 16, 2023","title":"[Web] JS - async & await","categories":"Web","author":"JSH99","emoji":"📚"},"fields":{"slug":"/Web/JS/async_and_await/"}},"next":{"id":"b7668856-9932-5657-8202-0053262ca4ce","html":"<h1 id=\"프로세스--스레드\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%ED%94%84%EB%A1%9C%EC%84%B8%EC%8A%A4--%EC%8A%A4%EB%A0%88%EB%93%9C\" aria-label=\"프로세스  스레드 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>프로세스 &#x26; 스레드</h1>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"정의\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%A0%95%EC%9D%98\" aria-label=\"정의 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>정의</h2>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 580px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 68.88888888888889%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"프로세스와 스레드 구조\"\n        title=\"프로세스와 스레드 구조\"\n        src=\"/static/8a15b0ffe792537083f48288cccc16a9/b6272/process_and_thread.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/8a15b0ffe792537083f48288cccc16a9/e9ff0/process_and_thread.png 180w,\n/static/8a15b0ffe792537083f48288cccc16a9/f21e7/process_and_thread.png 360w,\n/static/8a15b0ffe792537083f48288cccc16a9/b6272/process_and_thread.png 580w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 580px) 100vw, 580px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      />\n    </span>  </p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Process</strong> = 독립적인 실행 단위(실행 중에 있는 프로그램)<br>\n<strong>Thread</strong> = 프로세스 내부에서 실행되는 작은 실행 단위</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><br><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"process\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#process\" aria-label=\"process permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Process</h2>\n<h3 id=\"구조\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EA%B5%AC%EC%A1%B0\" aria-label=\"구조 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>구조</h3>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 720px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 66.66666666666666%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"프로세스 구조\"\n        title=\"프로세스 구조\"\n        src=\"/static/3dfa04c877e15698ce2e521b0a85614d/37523/process.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/3dfa04c877e15698ce2e521b0a85614d/e9ff0/process.png 180w,\n/static/3dfa04c877e15698ce2e521b0a85614d/f21e7/process.png 360w,\n/static/3dfa04c877e15698ce2e521b0a85614d/37523/process.png 720w,\n/static/3dfa04c877e15698ce2e521b0a85614d/302a4/process.png 1080w,\n/static/3dfa04c877e15698ce2e521b0a85614d/2cefc/process.png 1400w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      />\n    </span>  </p>\n<p>→ code, data, stack, heap 독립적으로 할당\n<br><br></p>\n<h3 id=\"특징\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%ED%8A%B9%EC%A7%95\" aria-label=\"특징 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>특징</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>독립성</strong> : 각 프로세스는 고유한 메모리 공간과 리소스를 가지며, 다른 프로세스의 메모리나 리소스에 직접 접근할 수 없음  </li>\n<li><strong>오류 격리</strong> : 하나의 프로세스에서 오류나 충돌이 발생해도 다른 프로세스에 영향을 주지 않음  </li>\n<li><strong>통신</strong> : 파이프, 소켓, 메시지 큐와 같은 IPC를 사용하여 서로 통신함  </li>\n<li><strong>생성 부하</strong> : 리소스가 많이 들고 시간이 오래 걸림<br>\n<br><br><br></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"thread\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#thread\" aria-label=\"thread permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Thread</h2>\n<h3 id=\"구조-1\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EA%B5%AC%EC%A1%B0-1\" aria-label=\"구조 1 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>구조</h3>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 720px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 26.111111111111107%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"스레드 구조\"\n        title=\"스레드 구조\"\n        src=\"/static/a9cc81d5455237ad2b3eb845ac3d7b0c/37523/thread.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/a9cc81d5455237ad2b3eb845ac3d7b0c/e9ff0/thread.png 180w,\n/static/a9cc81d5455237ad2b3eb845ac3d7b0c/f21e7/thread.png 360w,\n/static/a9cc81d5455237ad2b3eb845ac3d7b0c/37523/thread.png 720w,\n/static/a9cc81d5455237ad2b3eb845ac3d7b0c/302a4/thread.png 1080w,\n/static/a9cc81d5455237ad2b3eb845ac3d7b0c/21b4d/thread.png 1280w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      />\n    </span>  </p>\n<p>→ stack만 할당받아 복사하고 code, data, heap은 프로세스내의 다른 스레드들과 공유\n<br><br></p>\n<h3 id=\"특징-1\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%ED%8A%B9%EC%A7%95-1\" aria-label=\"특징 1 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>특징</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>독립성:</strong> 동일한 프로세스 내 스레드는 동일한 메모리 공간을 공유하므로 서로의 데이터에 직접 접근하고 수정할 수 있음   </li>\n<li><strong>오류 격리:</strong> 스레드 내에서 오류가 발생하면 동일한 프로세스 내 다른 스레드에도 영향을 미칠 수 있음</li>\n<li><strong>통신:</strong> 동일한 프로세스 내 스레드는 메모리를 공유하기에 쉽게 통신할 수 있음  </li>\n<li><strong>생성 부하:</strong> 동일한 프로세스 내의 스레드는 프로세스의 리소스를 공유하므로 생성 부하가 적음\n<br><br><br></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"다중-프로세스-vs-다중-스레드\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EB%8B%A4%EC%A4%91-%ED%94%84%EB%A1%9C%EC%84%B8%EC%8A%A4-vs-%EB%8B%A4%EC%A4%91-%EC%8A%A4%EB%A0%88%EB%93%9C\" aria-label=\"다중 프로세스 vs 다중 스레드 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>다중 프로세스 VS 다중 스레드</h2>\n<h3 id=\"다중-프로세스-multi-process\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EB%8B%A4%EC%A4%91-%ED%94%84%EB%A1%9C%EC%84%B8%EC%8A%A4-multi-process\" aria-label=\"다중 프로세스 multi process permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>다중 프로세스 (Multi-process)</h3>\n<p>하나의 응용 프로그램에 대해 동시에 여러 개의 프로세스를 실행할 수 있게 하는 것</p>\n<h3 id=\"다중-스레드-multi-threaded\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EB%8B%A4%EC%A4%91-%EC%8A%A4%EB%A0%88%EB%93%9C-multi-threaded\" aria-label=\"다중 스레드 multi threaded permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>다중 스레드 (Multi-threaded)</h3>\n<p>하나의 프로세스 안에 여러 개의 스레드를 실행할 수 있게 하는 것  </p>\n<br>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th></th>\n<th><strong>다중 프로세스</strong></th>\n<th><strong>다중 스레드</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>안정성</strong></td>\n<td>다른 프로세스에 영향 X</td>\n<td>충돌 가능성 O</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>확장성</strong></td>\n<td>확장성 제공</td>\n<td>확장성 제한</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>문맥 교환 부하</strong></td>\n<td>별도의 메모리 공간 → 오버헤드 ↑</td>\n<td>메모리 공유 → 오버헤드 ↓</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>자원 공유 비효율성</strong></td>\n<td>IPC 필요 → 효율성 ↓</td>\n<td>메모리 공유 → 효율성 ↑</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><br><br><br></p>\n<p><strong>references</strong><br>\n👉 <a href=\"https://inpa.tistory.com/entry/%F0%9F%91%A9%E2%80%8D%F0%9F%92%BB-%ED%94%84%EB%A1%9C%EC%84%B8%EC%8A%A4-%E2%9A%94%EF%B8%8F-%EC%93%B0%EB%A0%88%EB%93%9C-%EC%B0%A8%EC%9D%B4\">https://inpa.tistory.com/entry/%F0%9F%91%A9%E2%80%8D%F0%9F%92%BB-%ED%94%84%EB%A1%9C%EC%84%B8%EC%8A%A4-%E2%9A%94%EF%B8%8F-%EC%93%B0%EB%A0%88%EB%93%9C-%EC%B0%A8%EC%9D%B4</a><br>\n👉 <a href=\"https://inpa.tistory.com/entry/%F0%9F%91%A9%E2%80%8D%F0%9F%92%BB-multi-process-multi-thread\">https://inpa.tistory.com/entry/%F0%9F%91%A9%E2%80%8D%F0%9F%92%BB-multi-process-multi-thread</a></p>","frontmatter":{"date":"August 14, 2023","title":"[CS] 운영체제 - 프로세스 & 스레드","categories":"CS","author":"JSH99","emoji":"📚"},"fields":{"slug":"/CS/OperatingSystem/process_and_thread/"}},"prev":{"id":"6f8decb7-3cd6-5914-97e6-0964fdfd2884","html":"<h1 id=\"시스템-콜\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%8B%9C%EC%8A%A4%ED%85%9C-%EC%BD%9C\" aria-label=\"시스템 콜 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>시스템 콜</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>System Call</strong> : 운영 체제의 커널이 제공하는 서비스에 대해, 응용 프로그램의 요청에 따라 커널에 접근하기 위한 인터페이스  </p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 720px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 50.55555555555556%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"시스템 콜\"\n        title=\"시스템 콜\"\n        src=\"/static/92c9123cc9b385009267c960f915dfd3/37523/system_call.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/92c9123cc9b385009267c960f915dfd3/e9ff0/system_call.png 180w,\n/static/92c9123cc9b385009267c960f915dfd3/f21e7/system_call.png 360w,\n/static/92c9123cc9b385009267c960f915dfd3/37523/system_call.png 720w,\n/static/92c9123cc9b385009267c960f915dfd3/302a4/system_call.png 1080w,\n/static/92c9123cc9b385009267c960f915dfd3/47218/system_call.png 1344w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      />\n    </span>  </p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>사용자 모드</strong> : 하드웨어에 직접 접근 불가능 (시스템 보호 목적)  </li>\n<li><strong>커널 모드</strong> : 모든 시스템 메모리와 CPU에 접근 가능, 하드웨어에 직접 접근 가능  </li>\n</ul>\n<p>→ 사용자 모드에서 커널 모드로 전환하기 위해 필요한 인터페이스 ⇒ <strong>시스템 콜</strong>  </p>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"작동\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%9E%91%EB%8F%99\" aria-label=\"작동 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>작동</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>사용자 프로세스가 시스템 콜 → 커널 모드 진입  </li>\n<li><strong>커널</strong>: 내부적으로 시스템 콜 구분하기 위해 기능 별로 고유번호 할당하고 해당 번호의 제어 루틴 정의  </li>\n<li><strong>커널</strong>: 요청 받은 시스템 콜에 대응하는 번호 확인하고 해당 서비스 루틴 호출  </li>\n<li><strong>커널</strong>: 서비스 루틴 처리하고 사용자 모드로 전환  </li>\n</ol>\n<p><br><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"유형\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%9C%A0%ED%98%95\" aria-label=\"유형 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>유형</h2>\n<h3 id=\"프로세스-제어\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%ED%94%84%EB%A1%9C%EC%84%B8%EC%8A%A4-%EC%A0%9C%EC%96%B4\" aria-label=\"프로세스 제어 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>프로세스 제어</h3>\n<p>프로세스 실행, 생성, 대기 등  </p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>fork()</strong> : child 프로세스 생성  </li>\n<li><strong>exec()</strong> : 프로그램 실행  </li>\n<li><strong>wait()</strong> : 대기  </li>\n<li><strong>exit()</strong> : 현재 프로세스 종료  </li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h3 id=\"파일-조작\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%ED%8C%8C%EC%9D%BC-%EC%A1%B0%EC%9E%91\" aria-label=\"파일 조작 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>파일 조작</h3>\n<p>파일 열기, 읽기, 쓰기, 닫기 등  </p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>open()</strong> : 열기  </li>\n<li><strong>create()</strong> : 생성  </li>\n<li><strong>delete()</strong> : 삭제  </li>\n<li><strong>read()</strong> : 읽기  </li>\n<li><strong>write()</strong> : 쓰기  </li>\n<li><strong>close()</strong> : 닫기  </li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h3 id=\"장치-관리\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%9E%A5%EC%B9%98-%EA%B4%80%EB%A6%AC\" aria-label=\"장치 관리 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>장치 관리</h3>\n<p>디바이스 부착, 분리, 읽기, 쓰기  </p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>ioctl()</strong> : 장치 제어  </li>\n<li><strong>read()</strong> : 읽기  </li>\n<li><strong>write()</strong> : 쓰기  </li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h3 id=\"정보-유지\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%A0%95%EB%B3%B4-%EC%9C%A0%EC%A7%80\" aria-label=\"정보 유지 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>정보 유지</h3>\n<p>시간/날짜 설정  </p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>getpid()</strong> : get 프로세스 ID  </li>\n<li><strong>alarm()</strong> : 일정 시간 후 alarm 시그널 전달  </li>\n<li><strong>sleep()</strong> : 지정 시간 만큼 대기  </li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h3 id=\"통신\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%ED%86%B5%EC%8B%A0\" aria-label=\"통신 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>통신</h3>\n<p>통신 연결 생성, 제거, 상태 정보 전달  </p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>pipe()</strong> : 내부 통신을 위한 채널 생성  </li>\n<li><strong>shm_open()</strong> : 공유 메모리 객체를 생성 후에 해당 객체에 접근할 수 있는 파일 디스크립터 반환  </li>\n<li><strong>mmap()</strong> : 메모리 특정 공간에 파일 매핑  </li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h3 id=\"보호\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EB%B3%B4%ED%98%B8\" aria-label=\"보호 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>보호</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>chmod()</strong> : 파일 권한 변경  </li>\n<li><strong>umask()</strong> : 새로 생성되는 파일 권한 제한  </li>\n<li><strong>chown()</strong> : 파일 소유자 변경  </li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br><br></p>\n<p><strong>references</strong><br>\n👉 <a href=\"https://c4u-rdav.tistory.com/85\">https://c4u-rdav.tistory.com/85</a></p>","frontmatter":{"date":"August 22, 2023","title":"[CS] 운영체제 - 시스템 콜","categories":"CS","author":"JSH99","emoji":"📚"},"fields":{"slug":"/CS/OperatingSystem/system_call/"}},"site":{"siteMetadata":{"siteUrl":"https://www.jsh99.com","comments":{"utterances":{"repo":"JSH99/JSH99.github.io"}}}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/Web/JS/async_and_await/","nextSlug":"/CS/OperatingSystem/process_and_thread/","prevSlug":"/CS/OperatingSystem/system_call/"}},"staticQueryHashes":["1073350324","2938748437"]}